OL,3,GNEWSARoyal Shakespeare Company backs
OL,4,A#600m theme park plan
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Royal Shakespeare Company (RSC) has
OL,7,Fbacked plans to build a #600m
OL,8,Fhistory-based theme park in the
OL,9,FOxfordshire countryside.
OL,11,FFrench firm Puy du Fou submitted
OL,12,Fproposals to build the site, north of
OL,13,FBicester, to Cherwell District Council
OL,14,Flast year.
OL,16,FThe RSC described the proposal as an
OL,17,F"exciting opportunity to further
OL,18,Fenhance the UK's cultural and tourism
OL,19,Foffer".
OL,23,APub: 24-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
