OL,2,W//%*// //%Q,. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSARoyal Shakespeare Company backs
OL,4,A#600m theme park plan
OL,5,
OL,6,FPuy du Fou has said it aims to open the
OL,7,Fpark in phases, beginning in 2029 and
OL,8,Fthat it would employ about 2,000
OL,9,Fpeople. Its plans have sparked concerns
OL,10,Ffrom some locals, who have expressed
OL,11,Ffears about the impact the site will
OL,12,Fhave on things such as traffic and
OL,13,Fwildlife.
